{"id":"646a96fe655f6d74","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-lindenbaum-modal.md","title":"Modal Lindenbaum Lemma","display":"lem-lindenbaum-modal — Modal Lindenbaum Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal","aliases":["89-lem-lindenbaum-modal"],"display":"lem-lindenbaum-modal — Modal Lindenbaum Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-lindenbaum-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-lindenbaum-modal — Modal Lindenbaum Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38f802289559e5da\" href=\"?note=38f802289559e5da\" title=\"89-df-modal-consistent-set\">89-df-modal-consistent-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>将所有有限模态公式按树编码枚举为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0,A_1,\\ldots\">\\(A_0,A_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MCS}_L(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{MCS}_L(X)\\)</span> 为局部极大一致性，包含一致性与每个公式至少一种极性的完备性。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \n(\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{MCS}_L(X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \n(\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{MCS}_L(X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 6 章，印刷页 85–87；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n证明：令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0=\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma_0=\\Gamma\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{A_n\\}\">\\(\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{A_n\\}\\)</span> 一致则取它为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{n+1}\">\\(\\Gamma_{n+1}\\)</span>，否则取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{\\neg A_n\\}\">\\(\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{\\neg A_n\\}\\)</span>。两种扩张若都不一致，各有有限见证；把见证合并并用经典重言式，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_n\">\\(\\Gamma_n\\)</span> 本身不一致，矛盾。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\bigcup_n\\Gamma_n\">\\(X=\\bigcup_n\\Gamma_n\\)</span>；任一有限反驳已经出现在某一阶段，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 一致，且枚举保证完备。这里没有对局部新假设施用必然化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-consistent-set","status":"resolved","id":"38f802289559e5da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"A_0,A_1,\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MCS}_L(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \n(\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{MCS}_L(X)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0=\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{A_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_n\\cup\\{\\neg A_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_n","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\bigcup_n\\Gamma_n","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1382,"backlinks":[{"id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f530ad4c65761317","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4f2c4a3e09c03374","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a668d880013388bd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d5bc3d5ff97b8f74","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]] → [[89-df-local-modal-consequence]] → [[89-lem-local-modal-deduction]] → [[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]] → [[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]] → [[89-df-canonical-model]] → [[89-lem-canonical-successor]] → [[89-lem-canonical-truth]] → [[89-thm-canonical-model]]"}],"outgoing":["38f802289559e5da","56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}